ustained >40% YoY; margin: improving in Q4 due to turnkey mix; order inflow: INR3,000cr new wins in Q3; capex/commissioning: minimal for EPC; EV manufacturing capex ~INR15cr in 9M; EV leasing capex INR10-15cr","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"},"growth_optionality":{"title":"Growth verticals / optionality","body":"Green hydrogen exploration; international EV market entry (next 12-18 months); scaling BESS portfolio; monetizing EV leasing fleet via asset sales","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"},"margins":{"title":"Margins & cost dynamics","body":"Q3 margin dip due to higher BoS project execution (lower margin) due to delayed turnkey land handovers; 80% of order book is turnkey (higher margin); cost pressures mitigated by non-fund-based working capital optimization","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"},"capital_allocation":{"title":"Capital allocation","body":"Deleveraging EV debt via Refex sale (INR315cr); converting fund-based LCs to non-fund-based limits; equity raise of INR400cr pending from warrants (due Dec 2025); no dividend policy disclosed","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"},"management_tone":{"title":"Management quality / tone","body":"Confident on long-term vision, defensive on near-term guidance, acknowledges execution delays but attributes to external factors (rain, land); focused on deleveraging and EV production; avoids giving specific Q4 revenue numbers","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"},"risks":{"title":"Risks & watch-items","body":"Land transfer delays from customers; Q4 execution risk; EV production ramp-up delays; promoter pledge remains high (81.7%); Refex transaction timing uncertainty; working capital pressure from EPC growth","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"},"non_obvious":{"title":"Non-obvious takeaways","body":"Deferred tax asset of INR2cr created due to EV leasing subsidiary’s past losses — a balance sheet benefit, not a revenue signal; Refex transaction is a balance sheet restructuring, not P&L revenue; Ezio pre-orders are non-binding, no cash advances received yet","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"},"challenges":{"title":"Challenges → beneficiaries & losers","body":"| Challenge | Beneficiary/Loser | Dir | Conviction | Note |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| — | — | — | — | — |","src":"concall","as_of":"Q3FY25"}}}